     1	# V1: success definition and schedule
     2	
     3	> **Dates ACCEPTED by the author, 2026-10-09** (*"I'll accept those dates"*). The success definition below is the
     4	> owner instance's revision of a Codex draft. It goes into the 16 October amendment for adoption, and is not
