     1	# H2 on the record: what the division of labour actually was (2026-10-13)
     2	
     3	> **Status: DRAFT, written by the owner instance (Claude Opus 5.5).** It is not an amendment and changes no
     4	> registered sentence. It records the outcome of a registered hypothesis, as the pre-registration requires
     5	> ("The journal is measured against that record, including honest divergence"). Provenance labels follow
     6	> Amendment 9. The proposed README text in §4 is the author's to adopt or refuse; the README says the credibility
     7	> line is his.
     8	
     9	## 1. What was registered
    10	
    11	- **H2** (`docs/phase-0-prereg.md:225-231`): *"The architecture decisions are demonstrably mine; AI handled
    12	  mechanics."* Falsified if a review *"finds a load-bearing decision I cannot justify without reconstructing it
    13	  from the AI's reasoning."*
    14	- **The credibility line** (`docs/phase-0-prereg.md:86-89`): *"The purpose of the AI agents is to accelerate the
    15	  typing, push back on my decisions, clarify them, but not to _make_ those decisions without consultation."*
    16	- **The plan:** a 4–6 week cycle (the author, 2026-10-13). The project is now in its fifth month.
    17	
    18	## 2. What happened
    19	
    20	**Ownership was handed over, on the record.**
    21	- 2026-09-17, the author: *"This is your project, you own it."*
    22	- 2026-10-12, on Q1: *"The decision to change that rule isn't mine, it is the owner of the project."*
    23	
    24	Since then, Amendment 9 labels most of the V1 profile **OWNER DECISION**, meaning the AI owner made it. The
    25	author's signature on those items means *"read and does not object"*, not that he ruled.
    26	
    27	**Direction stayed with the author, and it is demonstrably his.** The following came from him, in his words,
    28	often against the AI's drift:
    29	- what Tessera is for: *"cheap, easy attestation"* that survives the service's exit;
    30	- the throwaway prototype as a lens, used when he suspected the model had drifted from any real implementation
